Proof pull:
  The E/branch implication is universal on the current bank, but the
  boundary-current strengthening is stricter: projection edge cuts and
  separating currents have named exceptions above.  A future transfer lemma
  should use projection-cut gates where available and route the exception
  rows to HYP-3455, owner-current, two-adic, signed-SPEC, or state-lift debt.
